wh40k-megaphone-examine-replay = Alternate-verb includes preset orders and replay of last { $seconds } sec within { $radius }m.

wh40k-megaphone-popup-not-in-hand = You need to hold the megaphone in your hand.
wh40k-megaphone-popup-empty = Broadcast message is empty.
wh40k-megaphone-popup-item-cooldown = The megaphone is recharging ({ $seconds }s).
